  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26db957dadee30a1ea2f6926",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7a9f97adb5bed9d4c6aca666dffd0e37fda970ebcfc2c8c0060523a483e295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd0c057f95aef3a28b5d8604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很幸运呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1347a2f4a99d62e5c3258fd609dcd8adda201ae7b416aaefd6f40cdf8bec19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04e145533b03271e58b4b16e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e23a2a933be63f7992ef78dc97543046307e6306c1a546d698062edb79747a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48c9228964dc7c8ce65c4b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7fdb9bafee73eb02ac8d2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戳戳……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd31dada8e0efa1523d2325bd76e34fd13f1694ca1f676ada6d46befea283bf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1abbc1d063381795b1d0b5d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81bbfcadc7b096bbec7263c4a502fbc683ad38cf63c74a3d2877521f6a468700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d746bd043476f69f7fcfdd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6d8458e0d0c283a28cdf0b2904ed93a7dfbc7b68b667ed9ee61b5a7aaf69e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30698faeefcef396f7a360a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天是这个。我会等着你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e98f62461fb864e1676fce252953053dbb9c29089397e568a6b73abd62a8a5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73453e369445e40ef626eb4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯~……我都长大了，\n体力也应该能跟上才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6802c970a9590649ee5466c92505cfc19a8af77059d2d103a4a6d5ad22e0159f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f4c52cd4395ad5a0d6747a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……没事的。\n稍微休息一下就会有精神了。\n谢谢你担心我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87f2e7e953781b13313271f7c87e8fb338cd5e29385a4af14dac75e9ce5115e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3b0a692da5343860eca5468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道的，如果是现在的我，\n能够走得更远——\n能够看到更美的景色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b1eea6298f04fc9c3ff7044292f5309d8fda3f7a66c492278dff9433bbb550",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1411d17a758931ea14b7cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那天的约定给我带来了力量……\n无论多远都能继续努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0bb1d262a95f070ff919a545022c47dfab741744639335f9086cd414ad24ca4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f51919cc76a471e65c167e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家今天很有干劲呢。\n呵呵……感觉受到了鼓舞。\n我也得打起精神努力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed4b225602e602ed9e58364a1d83a3db21337e97062f2ccebda5ca558d624ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdbdde70794c4c31447099d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那边的人们是来看我的吗？\n……那么，得好好拿出成绩\n才行了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36d79e47fa93e2e705749a42b4fa889728f66dbb587ed3abdca72e2398eb83ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34e29fcb079db6b51a507d0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也请多多指教训练员。\n……欸嘿嘿，不管说多少次\n都很令人感动啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f736d5ed60ce0f0e497c6a88c89019db1060dffe2a9e0f33c716dae4fbdc2f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8caaa807bed86b081efe1245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么我能帮忙的吗？\n哪怕是小事……\n哪怕能帮上一点点忙也好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4acb7ccf5325e6722d560f3b05086257b719cf2fb5aa69d95b38730c7b176eb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:727e4c1b7c07467d906707d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天头发总是是梳理不好……\n一旦状态不好就会像小时候一样\n变得乱蓬蓬呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5976dfbe5c756c119fe5656584ec4ed0fff5ce26e38e1598a195f0ba0d7050db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05bc047ad34fddfd4f97c307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便眼前不见璀璨景色，\n即便“绝景”很遥远……\n也要一步一步向前迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9739dcbadfdde8d9464a601db73a9ddbd140daa88db9db70c0d1aa0110430ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3003cf51dbc94520c04a4657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "煎蛋糊锅了，沙拉酱也忘了放\n……我今天是运势不好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01512eb168ae2b1fe0bef0d2740fa0cd9a9e666dbd3e213490ca58d418d7151d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61063f63774ea1df71fed1db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行哦，小景。\n得好好打起精神来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "802ef7ed130f6d9325fd2a87a9610ecb4979dd936536fdb9180b42352bc9e9e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3aeddfd9c95c87e92bf0587",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "硬撑的话梦想会越来越远哦。\n差不多该休息一下了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ae509dbb658826a1b465417916a4c443da22dcca0f5263bf20d9ea1b3b90ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c2eb786418f53e69237317",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再继续参赛也不会有好处的。\n还是重新考虑一下吧，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "367e6454adba95dc0e906ac8f6d9250beccce4e337f94cafc879f847d2b68962",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f87c8a45be884d7bfaf4887c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "留在心中的美丽“绝景”……\n我会传达给大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef331f06193e478d3cbde0b48d7346a94c68c8425c3dd4e4ba191623f3518d86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15ec881f2451f34638b0a28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我是无敌的哦！\n……因为你的双眼正在闪闪发光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d330733a71757ca9eab5627f1a3cfba9f6d4029a774accbc9878d920153bbb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9106a659f1e3135c8f9c6939",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着支持我的大家，\n还有你的心意——现在的我，\n无论多远都能继续奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cedaeba000ee27e052ab5f84f520a23e9f3ac26f7696da734a22aa3725f2d572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0225017018ebf340ace35cf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会赢的。\n你就稳坐后方等着吧，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04df34cec023be32c804efe2608c54235b753335dfa4394170b85fc0dd17d40a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19a1a0412100ce4fcd44e8c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以去看看观众席吗？\n我想在开跑前把特意来加油的各位\n刻进眼里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a5038f63629ca3bea98b99b604540597cda1a285e60127831c5017f7373786",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5569607d57480853134e5980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧张？……不，完全没有！\n今天会遇见怎样的光辉呢……\n我满脑子想的都是这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "237fc0cd581632d696655964ebaa1b9c428b56880c9e00a886ad735053870abe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91040480b47ac751b3918777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多要开始了呢！\n我们的训练成果，\n会好好展现出来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fec6c77117c2dd8dcd38319501f849ceb7f38b281d2ea0676c9b35e9e3d371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02be135595bb534b7198e6a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有你在身边果然很安心。\n现在也好过去也好，\n都能无畏地奔跑呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de04a237ab2731bcf9b590f70dfb301bffed26763681431728511756f8ebc52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb2642f200429fcdb9f1d35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心跳也好，光辉的景色也好\n都是一如既往。\n……嗯，应该能跑出我的风格！",
      "source_fingerprint": "069a383e37778855ae54c5a9b927b3f41e06371c6187fc78078218075c157af7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fa03e2aeae07521a9bbb61d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，缎带松了？\n……重新系一下吧。\n缎带系紧，心态也就能系紧呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69a9d26014798b7ec033bf734c1f37aa330f916cf8721a9a198bc065453a27e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e8ac2e284c3114facb89c35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想用特制沙拉恢复精神……\n结果还挺难呢。\n下次要不试试青汁吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3305c940e377cf68c24e17c192d5ad95e3995d11815b04804af56986b5cff2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe2f3db557940df1355247e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态不满，\n多少也能坚持……别担心啦。\n我身体很结实，这你也知道的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef2e8753401b37c440b12b3c21a4040287aa6e44b740bd79c9eea54448b0c97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18cabd8e4a7980e2cc52f9de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是艰苦逆境，只要不断奔跑\n总有一天会抵达。\n……无论何时我都不会停下来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de01a2c3aeb0df8cf7357f01d243c65279d9c030b148fe22024b9094ff5aa100",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c7afbbf8b47fdaad4e3128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有好好露出笑容吧？\n……太好了。\n可不想让大家感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c40fb966565f5c954cafd12c5e060fb94dd62ef10aa90f113087efc5849b91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:425889cd4c5f00472a7acbee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论低头还是转身向后，都无法看到\n小特前辈展示的“绝景”……\n得好好向前看才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d44a35be4eb79fde07a26337ddf4c07286d799296347f16253a88c00376127e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21686ff1e68b8ad53ff70888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c5cbcc66678513f705440b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6315497a6fb0538f36cc68cceef53a4880b3277bf37aedecbd0be6c79bfe3fbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f17e87718922c85839d58a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf75db030bef47ac10979fec78e5c0b913d4178a5e125af74bc5587432f2a12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed9e7746dcf927742e25524",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呣……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91b1c2f797f548e0ca8ebe74f69167d156757a0ee334d1fe25b9892930dbda3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a047d46eabdd0f0d1cec5acb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e23a2a933be63f7992ef78dc97543046307e6306c1a546d698062edb79747a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ef10d5406378ec2d5de279e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b05357a98db38f11a16fad4033cc61040131add0ed5671d232ae6bdb75a2680",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:369dafceac171dced3799e09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b62111a2b6023e711b71fe7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "787035567832d9131dc11cc78ef0e0b9c2c80c92bf02f7c0b18f7cb24d0e4e15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2793f004eb19f1d96d214133",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有你，离梦想更近一步了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f59c1ff5924276efa89ca7542492ea98bce965e312d58bd86dca0397a9a5f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a07beaf2ab5c078c21d57dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们有所成长了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c469e57a4496f9528e401a9a50135361a7c3e3149a049387d67534f77ebd8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e21d7cf14bf689fa8f035808",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起加油吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ad1c0e0857bce4cf553024380b2a49755752106372acf829b6da8220679ace0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ef37f5c9225a019adf441c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27034d160af1c1f09dc5bc82dd514313c27a89258641f741350dfcc49d329de0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed6a0e987db442f9cd8b294",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们的话没问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34d1070fcfb23394b80811f0eaf5380e29c64925365f0298bc7abd87631c2e79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88e5691521ca5549ff41fbc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们有所成长了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c469e57a4496f9528e401a9a50135361a7c3e3149a049387d67534f77ebd8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a405861c17d7e00524ad65f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧张？……不，完全没有！\n今天会遇见怎样的光辉呢……\n我满脑子都在想这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cdc4e01fab59ea3fa11852270fb11cadede9ff3ca428142174789034bf34029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d064f2bfd1f5b89e3a38b9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有大家的支持和你的心意——\n无论到哪里我都能奔跑下去哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbaecb33b130a9de572403a5640db5c3f9d6b77e945f2cb71bb9c3af8116c439",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb813923dd8ec5a92e63182",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们有所成长了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c469e57a4496f9528e401a9a50135361a7c3e3149a049387d67534f77ebd8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d521626bd5d0997fc55ce8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df613d0957416307249b32a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成那片景色，还差一步……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e10348cb238ff9e804bde636d364b79933891d52c3443197cd459594d7f0a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e4a06f75e4a29c6a3ae5454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着吧，下次会更加闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fba5fed582f192c22c2cb23bfaf86a890fc54d51d93a705291039ab253ac87a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfbe9fc112c6909494b0216f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们必须向前更进一步……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49655cfcc3887dd0831f48b633c940a502cfa84ffe86e8e3cf222a6eff40bd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:429ea3914d99ef35ca4c791d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被看到丢人的一面了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc49cc6ef454b4224da5befcc63a3ff1ee7aa71f404627d34056415c050fb22d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0131b7be82673a4803ec9c1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也看见那片“绝景”了吧……！\n……呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "835f060df6a76cae3a94b709b82b3292edd46feefb79595a67583a6748d3545e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba23ff55e964a38d104a1c0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢支持……\n大家的声音都成了我的力量……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d02ae2fcc2330971172b78740fb86753d7c88cde30cea30f2235d8e126bdf0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf293bbdd8f2611d584af128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a81719318f354a289fa32effff3e0060c6af596527f262f806d5f1b7f27b877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abe2e8bb64a0e9bf16a8087e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0177db8d422477ea9e6ce1baf2e66e59e717e34dda217aa42b208e08708aae7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e0c9268fe7c5fe421f9e728",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想法枯竭的话先来喝茶吧。\n低糖蔬菜蛋糕，\n宿舍的大家都很喜欢哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "de34169dc61e11cd4a590c0e8ebd452308aa2ff1f2d312c4f3fb9132ee09673b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8386dc93af1da7d2018f8021",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咳、咳、嗯。哟……哟兄弟伙。\n……啊，好像比上次\n说得顺畅些了……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a6ce0f9c9ace07d4ce0aeb2b7c8892408f2494cca76b6cce32656c251c8838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:809fe1d141f1c5d668a4982e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个约定，至今仍刻在心中——\n绝对要和你一同抵达……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "266051bf62fe6f8d25d49696dac1cfd83d0aaef8144833edab7db27f9ee83378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd91bfb479b6953be35007b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传达出的点点光芒，实在\n太过美丽……这充满回忆的照片，\n我想设为手机壁纸♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "faca058ddc4351b88747d58591def226836974e8996128c853783ced53af328d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dda74e920cfe25d027fd181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要把『谢谢』传达给大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16bf4c7d58168102fa01342ac34bf31a16d1d0c7a19e9343d7c8b607972734df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09bba97a8d2b28909f62c328",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使在舞台上，\n也要把最棒的景色……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1563babbfd2bf0f41cd3d544745fa0f6cd1b8f63838bee72dd5762f4a393070d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b1393d8f80312fa885e01ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那片景色，一起去见证吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "225a02a8978bb315112c7f61b32f630a3f720224dab0252f68e88f992a3a36eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5543d986a90c8d2c472545a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有着同样的梦想——\n能够共同追逐憧憬的“绝景”……\n有这样的人在我真的很幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d245a1daaeabd502982ced120e016fc244e5ab0fd8ee66f25a934253d2ba2b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07c7e93b7693d49bf158245d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套制服是努力的证明。\n就和你的徽章一样呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5189287b9070b4709de05ecedf2d4f1874f95bbca54807554ac954953dd28340",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b65bd089761eea6a76ce935f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便在Live上，\n也想让大家看到绝景！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3226896045fd3fcfb044a46447a4115b9d46091b681ab39b3819ee27106827b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd90ad570a24f86ebd6b67dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就用这套决胜服，\n来实现我们的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83af9d3798d1020b1235858d47f6067ee54cad1a1907b31d92d8317f5b71b687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a9e3ea3ba843532438d4f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能一起来到特雷森学园，\n真的像做梦一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3fb99c2007f3d5efd61e6b0ba2b63a4d94381cb3e6f64559ea607ef68351ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:248f666265df279e19201f01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使穿着和大家一样的衣服，\n你也能马上找到我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d557c66d7af6f7d686f844477a9aa8ff5f1ac8fd15d92e7b7bd1b4fc4d42ea6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f21a08935d4970edfff46203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣服上的腰带，\n一紧张就会忍不住去抓呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1dbb2b16ef5a1831eda04386b584331cfaa29b896435db938d8b6e98cb53652",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77264d2980c5d317ed819562",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，好漂亮的衣服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb28125eddaa1960041d122e354ffd7515aee6e714ecd7f2a4c934bac809d81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20c5fae92cf477e12bafa626",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？\n……有变得和平常不一样吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "873f581e62d58bf071c02f0ad35d2d66e9883ebd280c11fb9e32c5860a2bc6a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14da0cb98a98c86f1ba01238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐，一起出门吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07874cf38e99727b7ede81df4eb644d63dd9747967e0ecad768069c803a53c3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70020"
      ]
    }
  ]
